# The sentinel that runs .github/workflows/ledger-vignette-fetch.yml.
#
# Touching this file and pushing runs the D1b vignette's CC0 surface fetch on
# Jafar's PC, on the self-hosted runner labelled `ledger-pc` that three other
# workflows already use. It needs no click from him and no account: ambientCG
# is CC0 and nothing here is purchased.
#
# It exists because a workflow_dispatch workflow must live on the default
# branch to be dispatchable, and this one lives on the working branch by
# standing instruction. Delete this file and the push trigger together when
# the workflow reaches main.
#
# It sits HERE, beside DISPATCH, SETUP-MSVC and SETUP-BLENDER, and not in
# production/assets/vignette/, because that directory is the job's OUTPUT and
# a trigger inside an output directory is how a run re-fires itself.
#
# One line per run, appended, so the file is also the dispatch log.
